<title>USA: NN Ball president resigns, names successor.</title>
<headline>NN Ball president resigns, names successor.</headline>
<dateline>ERWIN, Tenn. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NN Ball &amp; Roller Inc said Monday that President and Chief Operating Officer James Mitchell has resigned.</p>
<p>The company said that Chief Financial Officer Roderick Baty has been named president and chief executive.</p>
<p>NN Ball, which manufactures precision balls and roller that are part of anti-friction bearings, said that founder and Chief Executive Richard Ennen will continue to serve as chairman.</p>
<p>The company said it was starting a search for a new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
